    wie Pani kto m\xF3g\u0142 chcie\u0107 j\u0105 skrzywdzi\u0107?\",\"parentUIDs\":[32],\"SpeechUID\":-1},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":41}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":531.3335,\"yPos\":733.0006},\"ID\":48,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Czy
    \\\"duchy\\\" nie mog\u0105 Pani powiedzie\u0107?\",\"parentUIDs\":[34],\"SpeechUID\":-1},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":50}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":809.33374,\"yPos\":340.999878},\"ID\":49,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Jak
    d\u0142ugo zajmuje si\u0119 pani seansami?\",\"parentUIDs\":[0],\"SpeechUID\":-1},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":52}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":806.000244,\"yPos\":541.000244},\"ID\":51,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Pani
    c\xF3rka r\xF3wnie\u017C si\u0119 kszta\u0142ci?\",\"parentUIDs\":[50],\"SpeechUID\":-1},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":0}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":741.3335,\"yPos\":732.333862},\"ID\":53,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Zmie\u0144my
